        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with the above back-to-back guarantee arrangements with the institutional funding partners and licensed financing guarantee companies, we and the VIE Group also engage third-party companies to provide back-to-back guarantee services to us, pursuant to which the third-party companies are obligated to compensate us at an amount equal to the compensation we paid to the institutional funding partners",
        "start_character": 34976,
        "end_character": 35389
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging on the proprietary technology and operation experience accumulated in China, we are exploring business opportunities in other developing countries with a significant size of low-to mid- income population.",
        "start_character": 35568,
        "end_character": 35783
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Starting from the fourth quarter of year 2022, we and the VIE Group provide guarantee services through our own licensed financing guarantee subsidiaries or through cooperation with third-party licensed financing guarantee companies for loans facilitated to the institutional funding partners.",
        "start_character": 34068,
        "end_character": 34360
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To better serve our and the VIE Group’s borrowers, we and the VIE Group adopt user-oriented business practices, including offering user service hotlines and online user service support on our and the VIE Group’s mobile apps and WeChat account.",
        "start_character": 14157,
        "end_character": 14400
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We and the VIE Group also provide guarantee services through our and VIE Group’s licensed financing guarantee subsidiaries or through cooperation with third-party licensed financing guarantee companies.",
        "start_character": 15916,
        "end_character": 16118
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We and the VIE Group provide loan facilitation services and are not a party to the loans facilitated through our and the VIE Group’s platform.",
        "start_character": 81950,
        "end_character": 82092
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We and the VIE Group strategically design our and the VIE Group’ loan facilitation services to target borrowers with different types of available credentials and therefore different credit limits varying from RMB500 to RMB200,000.",
        "start_character": 13755,
        "end_character": 13985
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We and the consolidated VIE are subject to extensive and evolving legal development, non-compliance with which, or changes in which, may materially and adversely affect our and the consolidated VIE’s business and prospects, and may result in a material change in our and the consolidated VIE’s operations and/or the value of our ADSs or could significantly limit or completely hinder our and the consolidated VIE’s ability to offer or continue to offer securities to investors and cause the value of our securities to significantly decline or be worthless;",
        "start_character": 148821,
        "end_character": 149377
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We entered into a collaboration agreement with Shanghai Caiyin in 2015 to engage Shanghai Caiyin to provide post-origination loan management services and manage our individual investor assurance program for loans facilitated prior to April 28, 2018.",
        "start_character": 935,
        "end_character": 1184
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our risk management technologies and the localization capabilities, we will be able to deliver more accessible and convenient financial services to better serve our customers.",
        "start_character": 36747,
        "end_character": 36927
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During the year of 2024, We and the VIE Group established an AI-powered comprehensive anti-fraud defense system through self-developed intelligent platforms, including the Qimingxing Intelligent Warning System and the Mingrui Document Verification System.",
        "start_character": 28314,
        "end_character": 28569
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-183485",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-183485-1363fb0c78c7323f",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-183485",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We and the VIE Group have independently developed and built the knowledge graph platform known as Xingkong since 2021, on which multi-relational graphs are built based on the graph database technology and potential risks are identified.",
        "start_character": 27895,
        "end_character": 28131
      }
